    gmeow:useWhen "Use to check intrinsic state or evidence consistency within an attributed reading."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid treating this law as proof of global absence, successful settlement or statistical correctness."@x-gmeow-english ;
